   "line": [],
   "spoken": "But as a newer player you won't meet the razor-sharp theory; you'll meet moves like the one in this game — which means you have to be prepared conceptually, not just memorize lines, so an early e5 doesn't make you panic.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Conceptual understanding beats memorized theory when the opponent leaves the book early.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 15,
