   "spoken": "Nc6 and White is essentially lost. The knight on d3 is a sitting duck — pinned to the queen down the d-file — and we control every important central square, so it can't escape.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "A piece pinned on an open file to the queen, with no escape squares, is as good as lost."
